Tatoeba replay diagnostic v3. Automatically generated pinyin/context, not human gold.
Source: https://downloads.tatoeba.org/exports/per_language/cmn/cmn_sentences_detailed.tsv.bz2
Snapshot SHA256: a8c53945a8806ce7b6e220585294bf2df4c021f2adfe9d0efc49b6db7e9c0af5
License: CC BY 2.0 FR https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/
Each contributor, sentence URL and original text is retained in replay-v3-annotations.jsonl.
Author/near-duplicate group cap20 balanced sampling, not natural population frequency.
1000 dev cases in 186 independent groups; 2000 test cases in 352 independent groups.
Full original sentence pronunciation precedes CJK-index splitting; raw punctuation is retained in context.
Training overlap was checked only against accessible local C4, not full training corpora.
